# FAERS Signal Detection Repository — Git Attributes
# Enforce consistent line endings across platforms
* text=auto

# Markdown files use intentional trailing double-spaces for hard line breaks.
# Suppress the trailing-whitespace check for .md files to avoid false positives.
*.md whitespace=-trailing-space

# Binary data files — do not attempt text conversion
*.gz binary
*.rda binary
*.pkl binary
*.pickle binary
*.parquet binary
